! ---------------------------------------------------------------
! THE CHECKS.  Twelve !SYM -- every NAME this page prints.  Forty-
! seven !CHECK rows.  Forty-nine of the fifty lines carry a LOCATION
! (line 47's CNOP emits nothing), and of those, lines 40 and 48 are
! DRZ rows whose BINARY OUTPUT column prints the reservation's SIZE
! and not its contents -- 000005.00 is five words, 000001.00 is one
! -- so they get NO !CHECK, which is printed pp.42, 84 and 109's
! convention.  Both sizes are still checked, by the rows after them:
! five words from 215622.00 lands line 41 at 215627.00 and one word
! from 215632.00 lands line 49 at 215633.00, and both of those ARE
! !CHECKed.  50 - 1 (line 47) - 2 (the DRZ rows) = 47.
! ---------------------------------------------------------------
!SYM   MPR2     215576.40
!SYM   MPR4A    215604.40
!SYM   MPR4B    215606.40
!SYM   MPR5A    215612.40
!SYM   MPR6A    215615.40
!SYM   MPR6B    215617.00
!SYM   MPR7     215617.40
!SYM   MPR8     215622.00
!SYM   MNOMCP   215627.00
!SYM   MOPCI    215630.40
!SYM   MMK1     215633.00
!SYM   MIFAS    215634.00
